# ============================================================
# 统一行尾，避免「Windows 上编辑 → docker build 烤进镜像」把 CRLF 带上线
#   py 带 CRLF 只是不美观，docker/entrypoint.sh 带 CRLF 会 bad interpreter 起不来
# ============================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# 容器内由 bash 执行，必须 LF
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.bash  text eol=lf

# Windows 上双击运行的脚本，必须 CRLF
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不参与换行转换与 diff
*.xlsx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.min.js binary
